<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady. Trade was moderately active. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1350 lbs 64.50-66.50, part load Choice 3 Blacks near 1300 lbs 67.50. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 63.50-64.50.  Select 1-2 62.50-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  Scarce, Select and Choice 2-3 950-1150 lbs63.50-64.50.  Select 1-2 61.50-63.50.</p>
</text>
